# The production Dockerfiles use this directory as their build context. Keep
# the context allowlisted so local databases, credentials, recordings, logs,
# virtual environments, node_modules and test artifacts never reach BuildKit.
**

!qwen-telephony/
!qwen-telephony/requirements.lock
!qwen-telephony/server/
!qwen-telephony/server/**
!qwen-telephony/agent/
!qwen-telephony/agent/**
!qwen-telephony/scripts/
!qwen-telephony/scripts/**
!qwen-telephony/config/
!qwen-telephony/config/**

qwen-telephony/config/local.env
qwen-telephony/server/static/dialogue-audio/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
